read 성공 ≠ 실행 허가." style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=none;fontSize=22;fontStyle=0;fontFamily=Apple SD Gothic Neo;"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="460" y="1150" width="755" height="57.2" /></mxCell><mxCell id="t6" vertex="1" parent="1" value="A: 수정된 query/set/cache 무효화 → 원본에서 요청별 재구성&lt;br&gt;공통: DENIED / EXPIRED / GAP / UNKNOWN_TIMING / UNAVAILABLE을 명시&lt;br&gt;원본 만료/철회: active query나 view ref가 원본 수명을 무한 연장하지 않음" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=none;fontSize=23;fontStyle=0;fontFamily=Apple SD Gothic Neo;"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="30" y="1250" width="1200" height="89.7" /></mxCell><mxCell id="t7" vertex="1" parent="1" value="B  producer 소유 게시 상태와 coverage" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=none;fontSize=29;fontStyle=1;fontFamily=Apple SD Gothic Neo;"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="1320" y="135" width="1200" height="37.7" /></mxCell><mxCell id="t8" vertex="1" parent="1" value="r2 / gap / permission 변경&lt;br&gt;expected source vector 검사" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=none;fontSize=21;fontStyle=0;fontFamily=Apple SD Gothic Neo;"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="1730" y="400" width="365" height="54.6" /></mxCell><mxCell id="t9" vertex="1" parent="1" value="input revision / temporal view 또는 query ID&lt;br&gt;historical refs / gap / permission epoch / lease" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=none;fontSize=22;fontStyle=0;fontFamily=Apple SD Gothic Neo;"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="1780" y="825" width="690" height="57.2" /></mxCell><mxCell id="t10" vertex="1" parent="1" value="채택 뒤 전송/게시 직전에도 owner의 현재성 재검사&lt;br&gt;늦은 invalidation event만 믿지 않음. read 성공 ≠ 실행 허가." style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=none;fontSize=22;fontStyle=0;fontFamily=Apple SD Gothic Neo;"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="1750" y="1150" width="755" height="57.2" /></mxCell><mxCell id="t11" vertex="1" parent="1" value="B: 시간/과거 view 사용 차단 → owner별 재생산/게시 → 소비자 재조회&lt;br&gt;공통: DENIED / EXPIRED / GAP / UNKNOWN_TIMING / UNAVAILABLE을 명시&lt;br&gt;원본 만료/철회: active query나 view ref가 원본 수명을 무한 연장하지 않음" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=none;fontSize=23;fontStyle=0;fontFamily=Apple SD Gothic Neo;"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="1320" y="1250" width="1200" height="89.7" /></mxCell><mxCell id="t12" vertex="1" parent="1" value="살구색 = 차이 Module/상태. 문서형 예시는 상태 이름이 아님. 과거 원본과 시간 원본의 owner별 revision을 남기며 전역 snapshot은 가정하지 않음." style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=none;fontSize=20;fontStyle=0;fontFamily=Apple SD Gothic Neo;"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="40" y="1380" width="2480" height="26.0" /></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram></mxfile>
